WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.200
Vinnie and Mandy hid behind the church benches and watched the two men.

2
00:00:13.201 --> 00:00:17.922
Columbus put his book down and hugged the other man.

3
00:00:17.923 --> 00:00:21.216
"Thank you, Martin Alonzo," he said.

4
00:00:21.217 --> 00:00:24.149
"We have much to do before sailing."

5
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.597
"The Pinzon family is with you!

6
00:00:26.598 --> 00:00:30.811
The sailors are ready too," said Martin Alonzo.

7
00:00:30.812 --> 00:00:34.831
The two men hurried out of the church.

8
00:00:34.832 --> 00:00:37.981
They never noticed the children.

9
00:00:37.982 --> 00:00:43.601
"Do you think he's really Christopher Columbus?" asked Vinnie excitedly.

10
00:00:43.602 --> 00:00:46.287
"Hey, he left his book!"

11
00:00:46.288 --> 00:00:49.909
cried Mandy, running to pick it up.

12
00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:55.587
"The Travels of Marco Polo," Mandy read on the cover.

13
00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.448
She flipped through the pages.

14
00:00:58.449 --> 00:01:02.891
"Whoever he is, he must love this book.

15
00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:07.506
He's written in it and underlined some parts."

16
00:01:07.507 --> 00:01:12.195
Mandy stopped. She thought she heard a noise.

17
00:01:12.196 --> 00:01:15.628
"What was that?" she said.

18
00:01:15.629 --> 00:01:19.097
"What was what?" asked Vinnie.

19
00:01:19.098 --> 00:01:25.107
A young man stepped out from behind a stone column.

20
00:01:25.108 --> 00:01:27.298
Vinnie screamed.

21
00:01:27.299 --> 00:01:30.816
"Shh! Quiet!" said the young man.

22
00:01:30.817 --> 00:01:34.124
He seemed as scared as the children.

23
00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:38.473
"Who are you?" asked Mandy.

24
00:01:38.474 --> 00:01:41.505
"My name is Julio," he said.

25
00:01:41.506 --> 00:01:44.847
"That man, Martin Alonzo, is my uncle.

26
00:01:44.848 --> 00:01:47.672
I didn't want him to see me."

27
00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:51.344
Julio looked about 18 years old.

28
00:01:51.345 --> 00:01:54.740
The children introduced themselves.

29
00:01:54.741 --> 00:01:57.933
"Why were you hiding?" asked Vinnie.

30
00:01:57.934 --> 00:02:00.520
Julio looked embarrassed.

31
00:02:00.521 --> 00:02:04.593
"Today we sail and . . . I was scared."

32
00:02:04.594 --> 00:02:10.144
"Are you sailing with someone named Christopher Columbus?" asked Vinnie.

33
00:02:10.145 --> 00:02:12.293
Julio nodded.

34
00:02:12.294 --> 00:02:18.484
"Wow!" cried Vinnie. "He's a great explorer!"

35
00:02:18.485 --> 00:02:22.139
"He is crazy!" said Julio.

36
00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:26.094
"He thinks we can find the Indies by sailing west."

37
00:02:26.095 --> 00:02:30.278
"Columbus knows what he's doing," said Vinnie.

38
00:02:30.279 --> 00:02:32.774
Julio shook his head.

39
00:02:32.775 --> 00:02:35.987
"Columbus planned this journey many years ago.

40
00:02:35.988 --> 00:02:40.779
But nobody wanted to support him, not even Queen Isabella.

41
00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:47.810
But now that Spain is a powerful nation again, the queen and King Ferdinand said yes."

42
00:02:47.811 --> 00:02:51.851
"What if Columbus discovers something great?

43
00:02:51.852 --> 00:02:56.787
There's only one way to find out," Mandy said.

44
00:02:56.788 --> 00:03:03.470
"He DID discover something great. America!" Vinnie said.

45
00:03:03.471 --> 00:03:06.956
"The Portuguese travel around Africa.

46
00:03:06.957 --> 00:03:12.795
They reach the Indies going east without any problems," said Julio.

47
00:03:12.796 --> 00:03:18.712
"When people heard of Columbus' crazy plan, no one wanted to sail with him."

48
00:03:18.713 --> 00:03:23.416
"So why are you going on the voyage?" asked Vinnie.

49
00:03:23.417 --> 00:03:26.150
Julio's face softened.

50
00:03:26.151 --> 00:03:29.110
"My uncles are the Pinzon brothers.

51
00:03:29.111 --> 00:03:33.256
Everybody here in the port of Palos respects them.

52
00:03:33.257 --> 00:03:37.802
When they decided to support Columbus, the sailors decided to go.

53
00:03:37.803 --> 00:03:41.168
I couldn't be the only one to say no."

54
00:03:41.169 --> 00:03:45.214
"How many uncles do you have?" asked Vinnie.

55
00:03:45.215 --> 00:03:48.076
"Three," replied Julio.

56
00:03:48.077 --> 00:03:51.055
"They are all very capable seamen.

57
00:03:51.056 --> 00:03:54.946
I came to the church today to pray for a safe voyage.

58
00:03:54.947 --> 00:03:58.281
I didn't expect my uncle to be here.

59
00:03:58.282 --> 00:04:02.386
If he knew I was scared, he would call me a baby."

60
00:04:02.387 --> 00:04:06.802
"So when are you leaving?" asked Mandy.

61
00:04:06.803 --> 00:04:10.595
"In a few hours," replied Julio.

62
00:04:10.596 --> 00:04:11.968
"I am ready now.

63
00:04:11.969 --> 00:04:20.463
I must get to my ship."
